<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese bomber flights and a surveillance plane continue near the Philippine coast and in the West Philippine Sea, while the Armed Forces observed 48 Chinese Coast Guard and PLA Navy vessels across four disputed features, more than double the prior count. The Philippine Coast Guard commissioned three locally built survey ships and three new patrol vessels, including BRP Patag, BRP Pag-asa and BRP Kalikasan, and received five new Coast Guard ships from Japan. French Navy ships conducted joint drills with the Philippine Coast Guard in the Sulu Sea. A Chinese coast guard vessel fired a water cannon at a Philippine vessel. The conflict records 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQbUJVQ2JZcnNsSFBFOTVuU0tTUjZUOHpSNFhpMXFkOVIxR0NFSUJ5d0F4a3BVa1BRcXdIUldMZjFKd1lMV2c3VjYxRHZEWnpvOTY2UE92dXowSUh6U00xRHpVYm52Y3VYQklTaVNQWFJBdFVFNUxxSk9uX2R6X25qNjkzNE1LOUM1a011ZmpUd29sMHI2OTdyNmJrSVFScmNUTkl3WFhfc0h4N3ZHZkctRnlWNFRncUg1Wi13SHVDU0ZldkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPNHphLWZobnlwMHJtR1JfaUpaYzNhQ2N5QWRNWUNTUF8tS0NtYzJBUUxaVlcyWjY0a29ZN2JVN1djSTZ0T25sc09LNVFHTlg5YlpWMklQLU1xaThnNFlqdmZlVm1fbTNKWUJnbEFCM3pEdHpLa0NuRnpjeVcyZEE0NnZObnFWRVhVam0xQk9RMHAxUkRqTW1EYmN3amE4OWotcFladGFES0hrWmJFd3B1Uw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Saudi Gazette&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPN0NBNURBMVlCcjhwUkpqYUxMYVdFQTNwQ0FZZV9mM3E4WjFobWl1WnNsYzRNRnpOMm80YTVOYnVnd3pZa0V0Vkp4cG93RlZHcXlLejluWUQ5ckNfTkZZXzVxQlljcnVZT2Z0Mm5SV0VocDk5X05pZDVROFBtX1JqcC1jRHhrMlVFX3h6eGQ4a05xMy1wQVJHdjBoZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;TV5 Kapatid Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOeERza1RQRW9yc2x3NU83WTBYMFRiTGZjTGljVk9jVjIzeU9aV3BvUndxOTBD